/github.com/samsface","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samsface/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-20T10:00:14Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T10:00:47Z","body":"Yeah I get that. I think what would of been really useful and useful in general would of been if the profiler told me the physics time was caused by tweens which really wasn't obvious. Godot's profiler was just saying 10ms idle physics time for no apparent reason and it took me a day to track down the issue and only with the visual studio profiler. Maybe I'll open a proposal to add tweens under the profiler. Will close this so.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3205303705/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3206519495","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109543#issuecomment-3206519495","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109543","id":3206519495,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_H5rH","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github